  <p id="c-songshu-041-zhaoempress-anzong:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">孝穆趙皇后諱<persName id="c-songshu-041-zhaoempress-anzong:p001:m0006" ref="r5n_x7v_cwf_AB">安宗</persName>，下邳僮人也。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-041-zhaoempress-anzong:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">晉哀帝興寧元年四月二日生高祖。其日，后以產疾殂于丹徒官舍，時年二十一。</p>
